# "Name Sticker" Goblin: "When this creature enters from anywhere other than a graveyard or exile". Entomb puts it into the
# graveyard and Reanimate returns it (Bot1 loses 3): it enters from a graveyard, so there is no trigger and no die roll;
# the pool is empty and nothing is on the stack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Entomb
Reanimate
Swamp x3
"Name Sticker" Goblin
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search("Name Sticker" Goblin)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard."Name Sticker" Goblin)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Life = 17

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Jet; "Name Sticker" Goblin
